<h2>About Movie App</h2>

<p>This is a sample movie management application created to demonstrate a modern migration from ASP.NET Framework to ASP.NET Core 10.</p>

<h3>Key Features</h3>
<ul>
    <li>Movie CRUD operations (Create, Read, Update, Delete)</li>
    <li>User authentication and authorization</li>
    <li>Entity Framework Core for data access</li>
    <li>ASP.NET Core Identity for user management</li>
    <li>Bootstrap 5 for responsive UI</li>
</ul>

<p>
    <a asp-controller="Home" asp-action="Index" class="btn btn-secondary">Back to Home</a>
</p>
